literal a few words in a sentence | split | join * / / 20 | console
=> a few words in a / sentence

%% readme-053-literal-split-join
literal a b c d e | split | join /*/ | console
=> a*b / c*d / e

%% readme-054-literal-split-join
literal This is a short sentence. | split | join * / / 10 | console
=> This is a / short / sentence.

%% readme-055-literal-split-join
